WEBVTT

00:12.490 --> 00:15.710
This is where the real mission starts.
Are we ready?

00:16.870 --> 00:19.320
What about you? Are you okay?

00:20.420 --> 00:23.059
You're worried about us, aren't you?

00:23.060 --> 00:25.460
Well... yeah, I am.

00:25.940 --> 00:26.740
What if...

00:31.270 --> 00:32.410
Don't worry.

00:32.700 --> 00:34.980
We have the Stigmata.

00:35.640 --> 00:37.350
You gave it to us.

00:39.860 --> 00:41.669
Come on, it'll be fine.

00:41.670 --> 00:43.879
If it comes down to it, you've got me!

00:43.880 --> 00:45.550
Yeah. Thanks.

00:45.860 --> 00:47.460
We're all counting on you.

00:48.430 --> 00:52.310
I'm pretty sure my intuition
is saying we'll be okay.

00:52.660 --> 00:55.359
You shouldn't rely on intuition
for everything, Marina.

00:55.360 --> 00:56.960
So let's do this.

00:57.790 --> 01:00.320
Biblion, your Future Prediction, please.

01:09.780 --> 01:11.559
You don't need to worry.

01:11.560 --> 01:16.269
There is no future in which
we turn into Shadow Stalkers.

01:16.270 --> 01:18.830
Really? Thanks, Biblion.

01:20.000 --> 01:21.459
What a relief!

01:21.460 --> 01:23.140
Jamie, if you would.

01:24.860 --> 01:27.340
Grant us the power to surpass
our physical limits.

01:28.090 --> 01:29.469
Physical Enchant!

01:29.470 --> 01:31.220
(Enhanced Stamina, Enhanced
Arm Strength, Enhanced Leg Strength)

01:31.600 --> 01:32.469
Refresh Mana.

01:32.470 --> 01:32.829
(Refresh Mana)
Refresh Mana.

01:32.830 --> 01:33.970
(Refresh Mana)

01:34.520 --> 01:36.039
Reinforcements complete.

01:36.040 --> 01:38.179
I can feel the power rising in me!

01:38.180 --> 01:39.949
Yeah. I'm ready.

01:39.950 --> 01:41.610
I feel so light!

01:41.950 --> 01:45.490
Okay. We'll all hold hands
and enter as a group.

01:45.850 --> 01:49.199
If the inside has already turned
into that transparent darkness,

01:49.200 --> 01:51.370
anyone who gets lost is as good as gone.

01:55.060 --> 01:57.399
This is my place.

01:57.400 --> 01:58.899
Don't let go, okay?

01:58.900 --> 01:59.750
Of course.

02:01.130 --> 02:03.629
And this is the subleader's place.

02:03.630 --> 02:05.579
Hey, no fair!

02:05.580 --> 02:08.119
Fine, I'll hold Rain's hand, then.

02:08.120 --> 02:10.599
And I'll take Marina's hand!

02:10.600 --> 02:12.439
Rune, come on over.

02:12.440 --> 02:13.300
Right!

02:57.140 --> 03:04.110
(I Left My A-Rank Party to Help My Former
Students Reach the Dungeon Depths)

04:19.470 --> 04:25.480
(Episode 22:
An Unexpected Reunion)

04:30.640 --> 04:32.989
See? My intuition was right!

04:32.990 --> 04:36.089
There's no point in bragging about that.

04:36.090 --> 04:38.179
We've cleared the first step.

04:38.180 --> 04:40.870
This is where we get started for real.

04:41.410 --> 04:42.530
- Cam!
- Sel!

04:46.440 --> 04:47.719
Clover here.

04:47.720 --> 04:50.959
We've entered Tenebre,
the reverse dungeon.

04:50.960 --> 04:53.219
We're going to try to conquer it now.

04:53.220 --> 04:55.130
Let's have fun, but be careful!

05:06.780 --> 05:09.360
Rain, anything on the Seeker's Compass?

05:09.870 --> 05:11.219
Nothing yet.

05:11.220 --> 05:14.280
Will that really tell us
where the Abyss Gate is?

05:16.840 --> 05:18.530
Yuke, I found it!

05:18.860 --> 05:21.180
Nice work, Rain. You did great.

05:22.200 --> 05:23.210
This way.

05:32.380 --> 05:34.380
Darkness as far as the eye can see...

05:34.890 --> 05:38.050
And this connects to Achromatic
Darkness in Finis?

05:38.340 --> 05:42.499
Actually, this is already
the inside of Achromatic Darkness.

05:42.500 --> 05:46.430
This unique oppressive
sensation is just the same.

05:46.700 --> 05:51.879
If we picture our destination and
focus on it hard enough,

05:51.880 --> 05:54.820
we should be able to enter
Achromatic Darkness.

05:55.120 --> 05:59.759
In other words, what happens
from this point on is up to us.

05:59.760 --> 06:01.489
Exactly.

06:01.490 --> 06:04.009
But that's always the case, isn't it?

06:04.010 --> 06:05.830
Yeah, you're right.

06:26.520 --> 06:27.559
Yuke...

06:27.560 --> 06:28.810
Is this...

06:29.240 --> 06:31.100
Well, how does it look?

06:31.400 --> 06:35.980
Geographically, it looks like Death Valley,
which was engulfed by Tenebre.

06:36.280 --> 06:39.740
Is this how it looked in the past,
or how it'll look in the future?

06:40.270 --> 06:42.740
Or maybe this is how it could look.

06:43.050 --> 06:46.179
Maybe this is what Death Valley
could have looked like.

06:46.180 --> 06:49.870
The dungeons that Achromatic Darkness
creates... and the people...

06:50.440 --> 06:53.469
I don't know if it's us or someone else,

06:53.470 --> 06:57.730
but it's likely that they're called
forth by someone's thoughts and wishes.

06:58.660 --> 07:01.380
Or it could be a memory
of the land itself.

07:01.720 --> 07:04.519
One of the potential appearances
of Death Valley, huh?

07:04.520 --> 07:06.529
I see, I see...

07:06.530 --> 07:08.590
I'll scout ahead.

07:12.280 --> 07:15.679
Jamie and Rain, use Telescope
Eye to check the surroundings.

07:15.680 --> 07:16.770
Got it.

07:23.910 --> 07:27.289
Is a calamity-class dungeon
the place to be flirting?

07:27.290 --> 07:31.230
W-We're not flirting! It's
to give her more height!

07:33.080 --> 07:37.119
Jamie, Rain and Yuke are always like that.

07:37.120 --> 07:38.329
Right, Rune?

07:38.330 --> 07:39.460
Uh-huh!

07:42.100 --> 07:44.260
Fly, my body, like a bird.

07:44.950 --> 07:45.640
Fly!

07:45.760 --> 07:48.680
(Fly)

07:48.980 --> 07:50.560
That which is both far and near...

07:50.890 --> 07:52.810
Look through my eyes.

07:53.200 --> 07:54.810
Telescope Eye!

07:59.340 --> 08:00.889
No signs of enemies.

08:00.890 --> 08:02.629
Nothing over here, either.

08:02.630 --> 08:03.450
Yuke!

08:03.750 --> 08:08.079
Bad news! The building that we think
is the royal mausoleum is exposed,

08:08.080 --> 08:12.359
and there are things that look like
Shadow Stalkers all around it!

08:12.360 --> 08:14.479
Are they protecting the temple?

08:14.480 --> 08:15.580
What shall we do?

08:15.890 --> 08:18.999
We have to go. The royal
mausoleum is the main citadel.

08:19.000 --> 08:21.929
We need to enter Achromatic
Darkness through it.

08:21.930 --> 08:22.829
Right.

08:22.830 --> 08:25.589
We'll get close and see
what it looks like first.

08:25.590 --> 08:26.089
Right.

08:26.090 --> 08:27.320
Okay.

08:28.630 --> 08:30.390
Marina, are you okay?

08:31.000 --> 08:34.830
Y-Yeah, I'm fine... I think.

08:35.640 --> 08:36.659
Sorry.

08:36.660 --> 08:38.919
If something's up, tell me.

08:38.920 --> 08:40.230
I'm fine.

08:49.490 --> 08:51.930
Come on. If something's up, tell me.

08:54.100 --> 08:59.689
Well, it's just... I'm kind of
scared, I guess. I can't relax.

08:59.690 --> 09:01.629
Well, sure. It's definitely scary.

09:01.630 --> 09:03.010
I'm scared, too.

09:03.310 --> 09:07.619
Like, what if the Shadow Stalkers
are people we knew in Ra-jo?

09:07.620 --> 09:09.749
I can't help worrying...

09:09.750 --> 09:11.390
You're so kind.

09:11.730 --> 09:13.479
It's not like that.

09:13.480 --> 09:15.020
Listen, Marina.

09:15.370 --> 09:17.929
Say you did become a Shadow Stalker

09:17.930 --> 09:20.930
and attacked us indiscriminately.
How would you feel?

09:21.830 --> 09:23.329
I'd hate it!

09:23.330 --> 09:24.899
I'd want to stop no matter what!

09:24.900 --> 09:26.870
If that happened, I...

09:28.090 --> 09:32.660
Then maybe that's how the people who
become Shadow Stalkers feel, too.

09:34.230 --> 09:36.040
Yeah... maybe.

09:37.150 --> 09:39.929
Sorry, Yuke. I'm okay now.

09:39.930 --> 09:42.420
No matter what happens, we'll be with you.

09:42.720 --> 09:45.049
Yeah, of course! I feel better now!

09:45.050 --> 09:46.300
C'mon, let's go!

09:46.710 --> 09:49.290
Wait! Don't just leave on your own!

09:53.590 --> 09:56.640
You really are a born womanizer.

10:00.670 --> 10:03.349
There's a big group of
Shadow Stalkers ahead,

10:03.350 --> 10:05.589
just past this grove of trees.

10:05.590 --> 10:08.820
We need to secure a path to
the royal mausoleum somehow.

10:10.110 --> 10:11.739
What about a diversion?

10:11.740 --> 10:12.580
Hmm...

10:13.000 --> 10:15.050
Would that work on them?

10:16.890 --> 10:19.240
This is honestly just speculation, but...

10:20.010 --> 10:22.509
Remember the destroyed Finis we saw?

10:22.510 --> 10:24.209
From the time I got stranded?

10:24.210 --> 10:27.279
Yeah. I'm sure you'd rather
not remember it,

10:27.280 --> 10:29.470
but there were Shadow Stalkers there, too.

10:33.700 --> 10:36.600
But that time, they didn't attack us.

10:37.510 --> 10:40.619
You're right. And we had
someone injured with us.

10:40.620 --> 10:42.879
They'd have had every reason to attack us.

10:42.880 --> 10:44.379
What do you mean?

10:44.380 --> 10:48.519
I think maybe the Shadow Stalkers
we saw then

10:48.520 --> 10:53.120
were reacting to the Prismatic
Missile I used on Simon.

10:53.410 --> 10:55.309
Your magic, you mean?

10:55.310 --> 10:57.500
No, the curse.

11:01.080 --> 11:02.500
I'll be the decoy.

11:33.280 --> 11:35.590
Okay, I'm in position.

11:38.420 --> 11:40.040
Scent of decaying roses...

11:40.590 --> 11:44.920
Sea that swallows the light of the
setting sun as the black dog howls...

11:45.260 --> 11:49.170
With the mingling of black and
white, souls vanish into chaos!

11:51.670 --> 11:53.680
Scent of decaying roses...

11:55.720 --> 11:56.839
They fell for it.

11:56.840 --> 11:57.740
Now!

12:00.680 --> 12:02.440
Sea that swallows the light
of the setting sun...

12:04.440 --> 12:06.650
Souls vanish into chaos!

12:13.280 --> 12:15.160
(Cicada Shell Talisman)

12:20.170 --> 12:21.370
That went well.

12:21.700 --> 12:24.089
Yuke! Are you all right?

12:24.090 --> 12:27.739
Yeah.
They're attacking the illusion of me.

12:27.740 --> 12:29.849
So the diversion worked.

12:29.850 --> 12:31.169
Any losses?

12:31.170 --> 12:31.880
None.

12:32.360 --> 12:33.440
Same here.

12:41.550 --> 12:43.229
No problems.

12:43.230 --> 12:47.269
Jamie, Silk, keep an eye on
the flow of spirits and mana.

12:47.270 --> 12:48.299
On it.

12:48.300 --> 12:49.559
Understood.

12:49.560 --> 12:51.929
Marina, keep Rune safe.

12:51.930 --> 12:53.239
Okay!

12:53.240 --> 12:55.169
Rune, stick close.

12:55.170 --> 12:57.110
I will, Marina!

13:03.180 --> 13:04.530
Which way?

13:06.260 --> 13:07.219
This way.

13:07.220 --> 13:08.559
Got it!

13:08.560 --> 13:11.359
Everyone, let's be even more alert.

13:11.360 --> 13:13.270
We don't know what'll happen.

13:17.860 --> 13:20.609
Yuke, you're too uptight.

13:20.610 --> 13:21.850
A-Am I?

13:22.310 --> 13:26.819
Clover's dream, the place we
wanted to get to, is before us.

13:26.820 --> 13:28.480
Give us the usual.

13:29.240 --> 13:30.370
You're right.

13:31.340 --> 13:33.480
The stream's up and running.

13:35.510 --> 13:39.100
As we approach our dream...
let's have fun, but be careful!

13:39.710 --> 13:41.120
Right!

13:43.120 --> 13:45.369
Burn the evil ones to ash!

13:45.370 --> 13:48.300
Grade 4 Magic: Fire Ball!

13:54.200 --> 13:56.039
Pierce, flash of light!

13:56.040 --> 13:57.009
Energy Bolt!

13:57.010 --> 13:57.880
(Energy Bolt)
Energy Bolt!

14:01.470 --> 14:02.050
Gotcha!

14:07.610 --> 14:08.429
Good.

14:08.430 --> 14:09.940
No, it's not over!

14:23.360 --> 14:24.450
That's...

14:26.760 --> 14:27.990
Rafuma?!

14:30.040 --> 14:32.710
Stop! Please let us through!

14:35.650 --> 14:37.029
Not working, huh?

14:37.030 --> 14:40.180
Sorry, but if you're going to get
in our way, I'm getting rid of you.

14:43.100 --> 14:44.549
Marina, charge!

14:44.550 --> 14:45.560
Right!

14:53.190 --> 14:53.940
Now!

14:56.400 --> 14:58.530
Magic Blade!

15:13.350 --> 15:17.170
So what's awaiting us beyond here?

15:17.460 --> 15:20.029
There's a dimensional boundary here.

15:20.030 --> 15:21.430
A dimensional boundary?

15:21.710 --> 15:25.219
Well, presences feel very
clear on the dungeon side,

15:25.220 --> 15:28.779
but more vague on the stairway side.

15:28.780 --> 15:31.189
I think the rules are different.

15:31.190 --> 15:33.159
Really?

15:33.160 --> 15:38.070
Is that why monsters can't
get into the stairways?

15:39.250 --> 15:41.159
The Golden Priestess does it again.

15:41.160 --> 15:43.450
You have senses that we
can't even comprehend.

15:43.770 --> 15:46.419
If you notice anything at all, tell me.

15:46.420 --> 15:47.170
Okay.

15:59.640 --> 16:03.590
This is... the pub in Finis, isn't it?

16:03.930 --> 16:06.649
No, we're inside of a dungeon.

16:06.650 --> 16:09.740
The vestiges of someone's wishes...
or memories?

16:10.300 --> 16:14.320
Yuke, I think we may have done it.

16:15.160 --> 16:18.730
We crossed levels, from the
royal mausoleum to Finis.

16:19.070 --> 16:20.390
Oh, right...

16:35.040 --> 16:36.649
What do you think, Rune?

16:36.650 --> 16:39.620
I don't know... But these presences...

16:40.130 --> 16:43.529
I think those people are Shadow Stalkers.

16:43.530 --> 16:45.789
I've confirmed it with Magic Sense.

16:45.790 --> 16:46.840
There's no doubt.

16:47.340 --> 16:48.450
And...

16:51.110 --> 16:53.719
We have to go there.

16:53.720 --> 16:58.110
So we need to pass through the
first floor to get to the exit.

16:59.580 --> 17:01.350
Yuke, look...

17:07.150 --> 17:09.140
Is that... us?

17:10.440 --> 17:12.290
Having... fun?

17:13.240 --> 17:15.620
It's not possible... But...

17:16.250 --> 17:18.540
That's a sight I wished for long ago.

17:19.040 --> 17:22.500
Is this one way things
could have turned out?

17:30.040 --> 17:31.399
Let's get out of here.

17:31.400 --> 17:32.510
What do we do?

17:33.210 --> 17:36.499
If this is a reproduction
of the pub in Finis,

17:36.500 --> 17:38.070
they won't attack us.

17:39.180 --> 17:40.629
You're right.

17:40.630 --> 17:46.530
Weapons, magic, and anything that
constitutes fighting is banned in the pub.

17:46.820 --> 17:51.280
Let's just pray that they're
bound by the same rules.

17:52.320 --> 17:56.929
Guys, let's split up to head for the
exit so we don't attract attention.

17:56.930 --> 17:58.550
Don't run or anything.

17:59.000 --> 18:00.790
Keep it calm and natural.

18:01.130 --> 18:02.349
Got it.

18:02.350 --> 18:03.650
Come hide, you two.

18:04.590 --> 18:05.540
- Cam!
- Sel!

18:06.630 --> 18:08.379
Rune, stick with me.

18:08.380 --> 18:09.180
Right.

18:10.900 --> 18:11.930
Okay.

18:36.140 --> 18:40.220
As of today, I'm leaving Thunder Pike!

18:42.680 --> 18:44.020
Just kidding.

18:45.990 --> 18:49.140
You know we're joking when
we call you useless, man.

18:49.590 --> 18:53.099
It's because we have you that
we can give our all in battle.

18:53.100 --> 18:58.979
That's right. Your mana restoration
and support are our lifeline!

18:58.980 --> 18:59.850
I know.

19:00.140 --> 19:03.110
Without you, we'd all be
wiped out in a heartbeat!

19:03.390 --> 19:05.219
Hey, c'mon, Jamie...

19:05.220 --> 19:08.069
Nah, you're right. If we didn't have Yuke,

19:08.070 --> 19:10.359
we might not be here today.

19:10.360 --> 19:11.989
No doubt!

19:11.990 --> 19:15.240
C'mon, Yuke, drink up! More, more!

19:21.690 --> 19:24.330
Hey, you there.

19:39.240 --> 19:40.430
What is it?

19:40.760 --> 19:42.229
That thing you're wearing...

19:42.230 --> 19:45.259
It appears to be a quality
Red Mage artifact.

19:45.260 --> 19:47.739
Could you tell me where you got it?

19:47.740 --> 19:52.239
Simon! It's poor etiquette to ask
others where they found their loot!

19:52.240 --> 19:52.950
Oh...

19:53.250 --> 19:56.040
You're right. I thought Yuke—

19:56.550 --> 19:59.830
I thought our Red Mage would
wear it well, so I had to ask.

20:00.400 --> 20:01.580
I apologize.

20:02.440 --> 20:04.369
No, it's fine.

20:04.370 --> 20:05.700
Don't worry about it.

20:06.270 --> 20:11.470
I got it on the tenth floor of the
Aureus Royal Castle Ruins Dungeon.

20:12.270 --> 20:13.709
Hey, that's perfect!

20:13.710 --> 20:16.720
We might get it
the next time we take it on.

20:17.090 --> 20:20.680
Thanks for the valuable information, um...

20:20.980 --> 20:23.940
People just call me "Warlock."

20:24.270 --> 20:25.729
I'm Simon.

20:25.730 --> 20:29.440
I'm just starting out, but I'm
gonna make rank A someday.

20:29.820 --> 20:31.729
That again, man?

20:31.730 --> 20:34.009
That's all you ever talk about.

20:34.010 --> 20:35.569
I don't dislike that, though.

20:35.570 --> 20:39.330
But it's still kind of
embarrassing for us!

20:39.650 --> 20:41.569
C'mon, don't laugh so much.

20:41.570 --> 20:46.330
We have to reach rank A if we want
to go to that Abyss Gate with Yuke.

20:46.820 --> 20:48.420
We can do it!

20:49.220 --> 20:49.710
Right?

20:50.080 --> 20:50.880
Yep.

20:53.550 --> 20:55.060
I hope you make it to the Abyss Gate.

20:55.530 --> 21:01.539
It's Yuke's... I mean, it's our dream.

21:01.540 --> 21:03.100
We'll make it there no matter what.

21:05.350 --> 21:07.799
Later, Simon.

21:07.800 --> 21:09.300
Yep, thanks!

21:10.110 --> 21:12.360
Hope we meet again, Warlock!

21:13.996 --> 21:15.215
"Warlock," he said.

21:15.216 --> 21:15.859
- Yeah.
- Right?

21:15.860 --> 21:16.719
He was a nice guy.

21:16.720 --> 21:17.729
He was!

21:17.730 --> 21:18.479
Seemed strong.

21:18.480 --> 21:19.539
I hope we see him again.

21:19.540 --> 21:21.129
Yeah, that'd be great!

21:21.130 --> 21:22.889
All right, we gotta do our best, too!

21:22.890 --> 21:24.150
- Yeah! - Let's!
- Let's go for it!

22:55.960 --> 22:56.739
(The End of the Darkness)

22:56.740 --> 22:59.009
Next time, "The End of the Darkness."

22:59.010 --> 23:00.970
(The End of the Darkness)
